{"ep": "19", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:10.66", "end": "0:00:12.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:13.45", "end": "0:00:15.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:16.70", "end": "0:00:21.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:21.84", "end": "0:00:25.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:26.13", "end": "0:00:29.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:33.68", "end": "0:00:34.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么啦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:35.17", "end": "0:00:36.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:36.97", "end": "0:00:38.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:39.84", "end": "0:00:41.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:41.57", "end": "0:00:45.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:46.10", "end": "0:00:48.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:52.46", "end": "0:00:53.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:53.35", "end": "0:00:55.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:55.27", "end": "0:00:57.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:58.17", "end": "0:01:00.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:02.73", "end": "0:01:08.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:10.30", "end": "0:01:11.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:11.75", "end": "0:01:15.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:16.21", "end": "0:01:18.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:22.39", "end": "0:01:24.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 20, "start": "0:03:09.87", "end": "0:03:11.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 21, "start": "0:03:11.39", "end": "0:03:12.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:13.11", "end": "0:03:13.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:14.63", "end": "0:03:15.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我为了你才过来的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:16.71", "end": "0:03:18.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:18.48", "end": "0:03:21.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:21.43", "end": "0:03:21.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:22.23", "end": "0:03:24.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:24.69", "end": "0:03:26.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:27.11", "end": "0:03:30.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天当然要有夏天的样子  要做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:30.96", "end": "0:03:34.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:34.48", "end": "0:03:35.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:36.02", "end": "0:03:38.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:39.64", "end": "0:03:42.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  麻烦阿虚和古泉搭我们到泳池了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:42.73", "end": "0:03:45.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以的话我也不想问  你麻烦我们什么？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:46.31", "end": "0:03:48.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们坐你们的自行车去啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:53.44", "end": "0:03:57.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:59.00", "end": "0:03:59.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 38, "start": "0:04:01.21", "end": "0:04:05.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这家伙  看不见这禁止跳水的说明么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:07.73", "end": "0:04:10.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:15.86", "end": "0:04:17.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿～"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:20.17", "end": "0:04:21.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:21.74", "end": "0:04:26.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:27.77", "end": "0:04:32.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说有事就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:33.47", "end": "0:04:35.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:36.14", "end": "0:04:39.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也有「择日不如撞日」的谚语嘛"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:40.14", "end": "0:04:41.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果她想到了什么鬼主意"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:42.16", "end": "0:04:45.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就不得不陷入麻烦吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:45.93", "end": "0:04:48.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算是那样  像这样也很和平啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:49.30", "end": "0:04:51.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:52.05", "end": "0:04:54.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:55.93", "end": "0:04:56.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:57.95", "end": "0:04:58.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:59.20", "end": "0:05:02.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 54, "start": "0:05:02.54", "end": "0:05:04.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是因为从初春开始就发生了太多事情"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:04.38", "end": "0:05:06.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:11.24", "end": "0:05:13.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真可惜  再来一次"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:32.80", "end": "0:05:35.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好喝  太好喝了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:43.05", "end": "0:05:43.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:44.13", "end": "0:05:48.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:49.39", "end": "0:05:51.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么春日会选择来这样一个地方啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:54.68", "end": "0:05:55.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:58.07", "end": "0:05:59.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了…这种感觉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 63, "start": "0:06:00.36", "end": "0:06:02.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也见到过"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 64, "start": "0:06:03.45", "end": "0:06:06.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥觉得长门好像有些无聊…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 65, "start": "0:06:07.34", "end": "0:06:07.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 66, "start": "0:06:10.51", "end": "0:06:13.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日说了这种话"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 67, "start": "0:06:14.37", "end": "0:06:16.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 68, "start": "0:06:16.65", "end": "0:06:19.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 69, "start": "0:06:19.71", "end": "0:06:20.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 70, "start": "0:06:20.89", "end": "0:06:21.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:21.97", "end": "0:06:23.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:24.58", "end": "0:06:25.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:26.10", "end": "0:06:28.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:28.16", "end": "0:06:29.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:32.11", "end": "0:06:35.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划  如何呢？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:37.01", "end": "0:06:38.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是干什么？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:38.52", "end": "0:06:41.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩余不多的暑假该如何度过的预定表啦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:42.28", "end": "0:06:43.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁的预定表啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:43.69", "end": "0:06:44.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们的啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:45.14", "end": "0:06:47.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然发现  暑假只剩下两个星期了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:47.82", "end": "0:06:49.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都愕然了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:49.80", "end": "0:06:52.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明还剩下很多事情想要去做"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:52.79", "end": "0:06:55.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但只剩下这么一点时间了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:55.69", "end": "0:06:57.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后要赶快地去玩啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:57.59", "end": "0:06:59.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个么…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:59.49", "end": "0:07:01.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 87, "start": "0:07:01.93", "end": "0:07:05.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 88, "start": "0:07:05.13", "end": "0:07:05.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:06.37", "end": "0:07:08.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捞…金…鱼…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:10.47", "end": "0:07:11.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:15.28", "end": "0:07:16.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:16.70", "end": "0:07:18.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:18.53", "end": "0:07:21.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:21.46", "end": "0:07:22.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:23.30", "end": "0:07:25.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你至少调查一下才实行啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:25.77", "end": "0:07:27.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查一下吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:27.55", "end": "0:07:29.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后把地点告诉凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:29.61", "end": "0:07:31.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  那麻烦你了  古泉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:34.31", "end": "0:07:35.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:41.25", "end": "0:07:41.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:46.45", "end": "0:07:48.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…啊  其实也没有什么事"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:49.07", "end": "0:07:51.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:51.55", "end": "0:07:52.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:53.13", "end": "0:07:54.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那太好了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:55.59", "end": "0:07:56.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:57.71", "end": "0:07:59.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…嗯…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 107, "start": "0:08:01.36", "end": "0:08:02.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打搅你了  抱歉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:03.21", "end": "0:08:04.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没什么事了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:10.79", "end": "0:08:14.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去搭腔呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:19.99", "end": "0:08:24.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉找着找着  突然就找到了一个第二天举行盂兰盆会的地方"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:25.44", "end": "0:08:29.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  这就是这个时代的风俗景物么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:31.00", "end": "0:08:33.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真亏得能聚集起这么多人啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:34.18", "end": "0:08:34.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:43.27", "end": "0:08:43.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:44.24", "end": "0:08:46.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有你想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:47.00", "end": "0:08:48.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "任捞任破啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:49.96", "end": "0:08:51.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也不能都弄破吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:53.93", "end": "0:08:55.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:56.38", "end": "0:08:56.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:56.99", "end": "0:08:57.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:58.90", "end": "0:08:59.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:59.86", "end": "0:09:01.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 123, "start": "0:09:05.76", "end": "0:09:06.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多谢惠顾"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 124, "start": "0:09:06.20", "end": "0:09:08.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 125, "start": "0:09:08.98", "end": "0:09:11.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但那种程度的我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 126, "start": "0:09:12.18", "end": "0:09:14.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呀～大丰收大丰收"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:14.58", "end": "0:09:17.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我们不需要那么多  就各要了一条"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:18.20", "end": "0:09:20.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:20.34", "end": "0:09:21.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:22.22", "end": "0:09:24.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你就不会累吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:24.90", "end": "0:09:29.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  健康有耐力  这也得上是春日的长处吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:36.40", "end": "0:09:38.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙又乱来了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:39.41", "end": "0:09:41.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:42.08", "end": "0:09:43.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:44.28", "end": "0:09:46.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:48.31", "end": "0:09:50.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天是捉昆虫呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:50.39", "end": "0:09:53.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:54.06", "end": "0:09:58.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么嘛  那种程度的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:58.34", "end": "0:09:59.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三天！？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:59.35", "end": "0:10:04.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉再玩到爽"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 141, "start": "0:10:04.28", "end": "0:10:06.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 142, "start": "0:10:07.21", "end": "0:10:09.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 143, "start": "0:10:09.73", "end": "0:10:13.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上天对于人的参数调整还真是不公平啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 144, "start": "0:10:13.96", "end": "0:10:16.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:16.58", "end": "0:10:20.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  怎么好呢…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:20.95", "end": "0:10:23.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:23.64", "end": "0:10:25.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这称号一点也不想要！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:25.80", "end": "0:10:28.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:29.09", "end": "0:10:31.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:31.84", "end": "0:10:35.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:37.13", "end": "0:10:40.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:40.92", "end": "0:10:43.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可应该说不出所料还是说啥呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:43.95", "end": "0:10:45.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:46.14", "end": "0:10:49.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:49.45", "end": "0:10:52.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:53.09", "end": "0:10:57.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "单方面捉起来再放生  然后再求什么报恩的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:57.62", "end": "0:10:59.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种人的大脑也跟虫子一样吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 158, "start": "0:11:00.25", "end": "0:11:02.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  回山里去吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 159, "start": "0:11:13.66", "end": "0:11:15.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢…欢迎光临"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:16.46", "end": "0:11:20.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们团长准备好的打工在等着我们"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:20.61", "end": "0:11:21.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  谢谢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:22.91", "end": "0:11:23.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:23.81", "end": "0:11:24.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我～"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:24.32", "end": "0:11:24.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:25.92", "end": "0:11:26.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:26.86", "end": "0:11:29.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "热成这样子还要穿这种罩衣"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:29.84", "end": "0:11:32.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是打工不如说是忍耐大会"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:34.36", "end": "0:11:37.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以说  工钱就是实玖瑠身上穿的罩衣"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:37.88", "end": "0:11:40.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:41.05", "end": "0:11:43.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:43.99", "end": "0:11:47.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:47.60", "end": "0:11:50.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把这只青蛙放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:50.46", "end": "0:11:53.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:53.52", "end": "0:11:54.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 175, "start": "0:12:09.68", "end": "0:12:10.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 176, "start": "0:12:12.60", "end": "0:12:13.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 177, "start": "0:12:13.56", "end": "0:12:14.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 178, "start": "0:12:14.86", "end": "0:12:15.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:17.45", "end": "0:12:19.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咪嗡…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 180, "start": "0:12:19.23", "end": "0:12:20.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:21.97", "end": "0:12:28.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好了  有非常不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:28.56", "end": "0:12:29.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真…真的是朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:30.12", "end": "0:12:31.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:31.85", "end": "0:12:34.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你…你怎么会这个时候跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:34.58", "end": "0:12:38.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况  也挺麻烦的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:38.28", "end": "0:12:40.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之现在是紧急情况"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:44.03", "end": "0:12:45.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么晚叫你出来真的抱歉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:45.61", "end": "0:12:46.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "发生什么事了  朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:47.29", "end": "0:12:48.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我要杀了你  古泉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:49.91", "end": "0:12:51.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  我…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:54.00", "end": "0:12:57.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不去未来了…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 192, "start": "0:13:03.87", "end": "0:13:09.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为禁止说明的事项  我一直在和未来联系和禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 193, "start": "0:13:10.58", "end": "0:13:14.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个礼拜左右没有禁止说明的事项了啊  有点奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:14.94", "end": "0:13:18.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正这么想着  于是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:18.88", "end": "0:13:23.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我吓了一大跳  慌张之下就做了禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:23.95", "end": "0:13:25.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但就算是做了也完全是禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 197, "start": "0:13:26.83", "end": "0:13:30.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我…该怎么办…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 198, "start": "0:13:30.09", "end": "0:13:34.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说那个「禁止说明的事项」是放送禁止用语吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 199, "start": "0:13:35.39", "end": "0:13:36.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "换句话说其实是这样"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:37.23", "end": "0:13:40.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们已经重复体验同样的时间许多次了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:40.78", "end": "0:13:41.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:41.75", "end": "0:13:45.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:46.55", "end": "0:13:49.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:50.57", "end": "0:13:53.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐无法回到未来也是理所当然的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:54.17", "end": "0:13:56.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为没有未来这东西嘛"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:56.27", "end": "0:13:59.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "物理性的No Future哪里理所当然了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:59.27", "end": "0:14:00.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信这种话啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 208, "start": "0:14:00.91", "end": "0:14:03.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 209, "start": "0:14:03.73", "end": "0:14:08.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我也想相信…但这相信的念头一点也没有啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:09.08", "end": "0:14:11.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  这原因到底是什么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 211, "start": "0:14:12.50", "end": "0:14:14.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你真的不明白吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 212, "start": "0:14:14.51", "end": "0:14:16.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也不想明白啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 213, "start": "0:14:17.35", "end": "0:14:18.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原因应该是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:21.73", "end": "0:14:23.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然凉宫同学本人没有意识到"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:24.53", "end": "0:14:29.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是恐怕是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:29.70", "end": "0:14:32.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:32.94", "end": "0:14:34.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:34.55", "end": "0:14:39.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:39.81", "end": "0:14:43.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还真是个\n会把一些莫名其妙的事情展开到大宇宙规模的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:45.59", "end": "0:14:50.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之现在  最近频繁发生的既视感之迷终于解开了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:50.83", "end": "0:14:51.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也有吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:52.02", "end": "0:14:54.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说  全世界的人都感觉得到吗…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:55.13", "end": "0:14:57.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  好像不是那样子的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:57.65", "end": "0:15:02.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 225, "start": "0:15:03.35", "end": "0:15:05.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 226, "start": "0:15:05.76", "end": "0:15:11.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 227, "start": "0:15:12.23", "end": "0:15:14.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 228, "start": "0:15:14.84", "end": "0:15:16.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 229, "start": "0:15:19.37", "end": "0:15:20.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 230, "start": "0:15:20.81", "end": "0:15:21.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 231, "start": "0:15:21.80", "end": "0:15:23.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 232, "start": "0:15:23.70", "end": "0:15:24.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 233, "start": "0:15:24.48", "end": "0:15:27.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  这重复现在到底是第几次了？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:29.72", "end": "0:15:33.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15532次"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:40.65", "end": "0:15:43.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15532次？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:44.18", "end": "0:15:46.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:48.03", "end": "0:15:49.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:49.56", "end": "0:15:50.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:50.62", "end": "0:15:54.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:54.97", "end": "0:15:56.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:58.92", "end": "0:16:07.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15532次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 242, "start": "0:16:07.58", "end": "0:16:12.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 243, "start": "0:16:12.43", "end": "0:16:16.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9056次  其内容有6个模式"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 244, "start": "0:16:17.38", "end": "0:16:22.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了发放气球  还有搬货物  做收银员  发放传单  接电话…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 245, "start": "0:16:22.16", "end": "0:16:25.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不  已经够了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:29.22", "end": "0:16:31.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15532次…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:32.52", "end": "0:16:33.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 248, "start": "0:16:34.27", "end": "0:16:36.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 249, "start": "0:16:36.75", "end": "0:16:38.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是595年的时间了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:39.44", "end": "0:16:41.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:41.67", "end": "0:16:45.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:47.60", "end": "0:16:52.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都是以什么样的心情度过的啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:59.19", "end": "0:17:01.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又听了荒唐的话了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 254, "start": "0:17:07.90", "end": "0:17:10.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 255, "start": "0:17:11.11", "end": "0:17:12.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门的公寓"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 256, "start": "0:17:13.42", "end": "0:17:16.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然春日一开始想要望远镜但…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 257, "start": "0:17:21.27", "end": "0:17:23.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 258, "start": "0:17:23.79", "end": "0:17:25.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 259, "start": "0:17:25.86", "end": "0:17:28.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个能搞清楚的话  问题也就迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 260, "start": "0:17:30.39", "end": "0:17:32.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 261, "start": "0:17:32.73", "end": "0:17:34.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:35.34", "end": "0:17:37.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:38.35", "end": "0:17:39.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:40.09", "end": "0:17:42.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你以外  有没有适合的人呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:42.53", "end": "0:17:45.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的回合  发动拒绝权"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:45.43", "end": "0:17:47.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:56.21", "end": "0:17:59.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的  我做这角色还不够格"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:59.96", "end": "0:18:02.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样只会让凉宫同学增加无谓的混乱吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 269, "start": "0:18:11.63", "end": "0:18:15.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怒涛般的暑假活动消化体制还在继续"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 270, "start": "0:18:15.99", "end": "0:18:20.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们去了真正的烟花大会  也参加了钓虾虎鱼大会"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 271, "start": "0:18:20.57", "end": "0:18:26.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其它还有试胆  电影连看  海水浴  打保龄  卡拉OK什么的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 272, "start": "0:18:26.92", "end": "0:18:29.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在活动来活动去的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 273, "start": "0:18:29.85", "end": "0:18:33.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然我觉得春日应该不会这样就满足"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 274, "start": "0:18:33.89", "end": "0:18:36.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但即便如此也没有什么行动"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:36.87", "end": "0:18:40.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样  只有暑假剩余的日子是确实在一天天减少"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:41.23", "end": "0:18:44.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后终于来到了  八月三十日"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:49.00", "end": "0:18:52.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…这样课题就如实地完成了呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:58.61", "end": "0:19:01.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子…好吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 279, "start": "0:19:03.74", "end": "0:19:06.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…也就这样了呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 280, "start": "0:19:06.98", "end": "0:19:09.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  各位还有什么想做的吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 281, "start": "0:19:20.02", "end": "0:19:21.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  够了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 282, "start": "0:19:21.60", "end": "0:19:25.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个暑假已经做了很多事了  已经很充实了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 283, "start": "0:19:25.54", "end": "0:19:26.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不好！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 284, "start": "0:19:27.17", "end": "0:19:29.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你应该还没有满足才对！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 285, "start": "0:19:31.63", "end": "0:19:33.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 286, "start": "0:19:33.43", "end": "0:19:37.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 287, "start": "0:19:37.54", "end": "0:19:39.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 288, "start": "0:19:40.07", "end": "0:19:41.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等…等等  春日"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 289, "start": "0:19:45.13", "end": "0:19:46.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又…又来了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 290, "start": "0:19:46.80", "end": "0:19:48.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还前所未有地强烈"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 291, "start": "0:19:49.43", "end": "0:19:51.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是那重复了一万几千次的色彩"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 292, "start": "0:19:53.27", "end": "0:19:54.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不能就这么让春日回去"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 293, "start": "0:19:55.20", "end": "0:19:58.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不然的话  又要回到那重复的两星期的窘境了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 294, "start": "0:19:59.38", "end": "0:20:01.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  我该做什么呢"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 295, "start": "0:20:01.58", "end": "0:20:04.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在春日的话里应该有提示的"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 296, "start": "0:20:04.34", "end": "0:20:05.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是什么  是什么  是什么"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 297, "start": "0:20:06.10", "end": "0:20:07.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想起来  想起来啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 298, "start": "0:20:07.88", "end": "0:20:11.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对我来说是非常揪心的  就算要延期去做也要做的事情"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 299, "start": "0:20:11.76", "end": "0:20:13.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么都不做的话  春日就要回去了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 300, "start": "0:20:13.83", "end": "0:20:14.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那样就糟了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 301, "start": "0:20:14.98", "end": "0:20:16.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那样就什么改变都没有！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 302, "start": "0:20:16.80", "end": "0:20:21.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至今为止的我们在这一瞬间都做了什么  还有什么没做！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 303, "start": "0:20:23.03", "end": "0:20:24.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有考虑的闲暇了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 304, "start": "0:20:24.89", "end": "0:20:25.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "死马当活马医了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 305, "start": "0:20:26.32", "end": "0:20:28.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说点什么啊  说啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 306, "start": "0:20:44.20", "end": "0:20:45.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的课题…"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 307, "start": "0:20:45.94", "end": "0:20:47.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还没有做完啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 308, "start": "0:20:53.71", "end": "0:20:54.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:56.31", "end": "0:20:57.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  作业啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:57.91", "end": "0:20:58.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…你在说什么啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:59.28", "end": "0:21:01.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的暑假作业一个字都没动过！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 312, "start": "0:21:02.27", "end": "0:21:04.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不解决那个的话  我的夏天就结束不了了！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 313, "start": "0:21:05.42", "end": "0:21:06.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…你是笨蛋吗？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 314, "start": "0:21:06.46", "end": "0:21:08.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你完成了吗？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 315, "start": "0:21:08.67", "end": "0:21:11.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…没有  慌里慌张做了些  但才做完一半"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 316, "start": "0:21:11.73", "end": "0:21:12.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那一起来吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 317, "start": "0:21:13.17", "end": "0:21:15.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门也来啊  你也没完成吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 318, "start": "0:21:15.58", "end": "0:21:17.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外朝比奈学姐也来吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 319, "start": "0:21:17.59", "end": "0:21:19.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  但是…去哪里做呢？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 320, "start": "0:21:19.51", "end": "0:21:20.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来我家吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 321, "start": "0:21:21.10", "end": "0:21:24.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笔记啊  试卷啊全都带来  好好地搞定它吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:25.11", "end": "0:21:27.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要让这个暑假的课题全部结束掉"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:28.15", "end": "0:21:30.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门和古泉  做完的部分都让我抄！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:31.18", "end": "0:21:31.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:32.00", "end": "0:21:36.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  那么就从明早开始  一天怎么都要搞定！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:36.77", "end": "0:21:37.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等下"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:42.69", "end": "0:21:44.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要擅自决定啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:44.37", "end": "0:21:48.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "团长可是我啊  这种时候要先问下我的意见啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:48.81", "end": "0:21:52.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  团员的独断行动可是重大的违纪啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:59.76", "end": "0:22:01.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也要去啊！"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 331, "start": "0:22:36.20", "end": "0:22:38.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看样子是猜对了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 332, "start": "0:22:39.46", "end": "0:22:42.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学真是文武双全啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 333, "start": "0:22:43.04", "end": "0:22:45.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该是从小开始就这样了吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 334, "start": "0:22:45.96", "end": "0:22:51.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以她从来不觉得做暑假作业是一种负担"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 335, "start": "0:22:51.84", "end": "0:22:57.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "估计之前没有和朋友们分工完成过作业吧"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 336, "start": "0:23:00.33", "end": "0:23:03.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开学典礼这天回来不知是好是坏"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 337, "start": "0:23:03.68", "end": "0:23:05.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之我已经到这里了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 338, "start": "0:23:05.84", "end": "0:23:08.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和同样前来的古泉一起这么坐着"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 339, "start": "0:23:09.79", "end": "0:23:12.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最恐怖也最重要的是  长门居然不在"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 340, "start": "0:23:13.81", "end": "0:23:18.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然没有表现在脸上  那家伙估计也累了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 341, "start": "0:23:20.47", "end": "0:23:25.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "过了一万几千次的八月后半  感觉像骗人一样啊"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 342, "start": "0:23:26.32", "end": "0:23:28.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会这么想也不怪你"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 343, "start": "0:23:29.14", "end": "0:23:32.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接连度过了过去的15531次的我们"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 344, "start": "0:23:33.12", "end": "0:23:36.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与现在我们的记忆并不共有"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 345, "start": "0:23:36.75", "end": "0:23:43.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只有第15532次的我们再次回到了正确的时间里"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 346, "start": "0:23:44.98", "end": "0:23:46.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要玩梭哈吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 347, "start": "0:23:47.72", "end": "0:23:48.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  也好"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 348, "start": "0:23:49.23", "end": "0:23:50.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带一句我可没钱哦"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 349, "start": "0:23:51.05", "end": "0:23:52.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么就不押注了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 350, "start": "0:23:53.33", "end": "0:23:55.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过  我知道提示了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 351, "start": "0:23:56.01", "end": "0:23:59.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那多次的既视感  尤其是最后感觉到的那个"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 352, "start": "0:24:00.04", "end": "0:24:03.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许是过去身处同处的我们送来的礼物"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 353, "start": "0:24:04.76", "end": "0:24:10.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有现在的我  多亏了度过之前两星期的那些「我们」"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 354, "start": "0:24:10.77", "end": "0:24:18.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不这么想的话  由于春日而失去的他们的暑假不是都白费了吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 355, "start": "0:24:20.59", "end": "0:24:21.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 356, "start": "0:24:22.39", "end": "0:24:23.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要换牌吗"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 357, "start": "0:24:23.52", "end": "0:24:24.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 358, "start": "0:24:24.49", "end": "0:24:25.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 359, "start": "0:24:26.58", "end": "0:24:29.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是有再过一次今天的机会的话"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 360, "start": "0:24:30.61", "end": "0:24:31.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦～"}
{"ep": "19", "idx": 361, "start": "0:24:32.17", "end": "0:24:35.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一定要记得下赌注啊"}
